==English==

===Adverb===
'''[[day]] [[in]], day [[out]]'''

# {{idiom}} Every day; [[daily]]; [[constantly]] or [[continuously]]; especially, of something that has become [[routine]] or [[monotonous]].
#: ''Even if you like peanut butter sandwiches, eating the same sandwiches '''day in, day out''' will get old.''

